<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Emerging substance alerts | PharmacyNews</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/atlas/style.css"><style>main{max-width:1000px;margin:auto;padding:24px}article{border:1px solid #666;padding:20px;margin:20px 0}a{color:#f5ad62}label{display:block;margin:10px 0}input,select,button{font:inherit;padding:8px;max-width:100%}a:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #cba5f0}dt{font-weight:bold}dd{margin:0 0 10px}</style></head><body><main><a href="/">Back to global monitor</a><h1>Emerging illicit-substance alerts</h1><p>New substances and known drugs of abuse. Official reports describe detections and alerts, not population prevalence. No reports does not mean no harm. Locations are reported areas, not publisher headquarters or patient locations.</p>
<form method="get"><label for="substance">Substance<input id="substance" name="substance" value="<%= query %>"></label><label for="category">Alert category<select id="category" name="category"><option value="">All categories</option><% categories.forEach(c=>{%><option value="<%=c%>" <%= c===category?'selected':'' %>><%=c.replaceAll('_',' ')%></option><%})%></select></label><% if(typeof regions!=='undefined'){ %><label for="region">WHO region (official titles)<select id="region" name="region"><option value="">All regions</option><% Object.entries(regions).forEach(([k,v])=>{%><option value="<%=k%>" <%= k===region?'selected':'' %>><%=v%></option><%})%></select></label><% } %><button type="submit">Filter alerts</button></form>
<p role="status"><%= events.length %> reviewed reports match. No live or comprehensive worldwide surveillance is claimed.</p>
<% if(!events.length){%><article><h2>No reviewed alerts available for this selection</h2><p>Reviewed alerts appear only after editorial, evidence and rights review. Collected official titles are listed separately as unreviewed and are not promoted into geographic events. Unverified event dates and areas must remain unknown.</p></article><%}%>
<% if(typeof official!=='undefined'){ %><section aria-labelledby="official-alerts"><h2 id="official-alerts">Official alert titles (unreviewed)</h2><p><%= official.label %> <%= official.statement %></p><p role="status"><%= official.totals.reports %> official titles in the last <%= official.window_days %> days<%= query?' mention “'+query+'”':'' %>. Collection: <%= official.collection.schedule_enabled?'every 6 hours':'paused' %><%= official.collection.last_completed_at?', last run '+official.collection.last_completed_at.slice(0,16).replace('T',' ')+' UTC':'' %>.</p>
<% if(!official.reports.length){%><p>No official titles match. That does not mean there are no drug hazards; several national alert systems are blocked or not yet connected.</p><%}%>
<% official.reports.slice(0,80).forEach(r=>{%><article><h3><a href="<%= r.source_url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><%= r.title %></a></h3><p><%= r.issuer %> · <%= r.report_date?r.report_date.slice(0,10):'date not given' %> · <%= r.countries.map(c=>c.name).join(', ')||'Place not named in title' %><%= r.alert_category?' · '+r.alert_category.replaceAll('_',' '):'' %><%= r.translation_note?' · '+r.translation_note:'' %></p><p>Unreviewed. A warning or detection does not measure prevalence. Read the official source for details.</p></article><%})%></section><% } %>
<% if(events.length){%><h2>Reviewed alerts</h2><%}%><% events.forEach(e=>{%><article><h2><%=e.title%></h2><% if(e.stale){%><p role="alert">Source check older than seven days — this may be a superseded alert.</p><%}%><dl><dt>Substance / category</dt><dd><%=e.substance%> / <%=e.category.replaceAll('_',' ')%></dd><dt>Confirmation</dt><dd><%=e.confirmation%></dd><dt>Event / report date</dt><dd><%=e.event_date||'Unknown'%> / <%=e.report_date%></dd><dt>Reported area / precision</dt><dd><%=e.location.name||'Unknown'%> / <%=e.location.precision%></dd><dt>Source checked / editorial review</dt><dd><%=e.checked_at%> / <%=e.reviewed_at%></dd><dt>Uncertainty</dt><dd><%=e.uncertainty%></dd></dl><a href="<%=e.source_url%>" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official source: <%=e.source%></a><p>No substance procurement, preparation or patient-specific treatment instructions.</p></article><%})%></main></body></html>
